      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alola !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006F006C006100200021001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je suis membre de l’Union de Lutte pour\nle Triomphe des Raichu d’Alola !<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nSoit « l’ULTRA » !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bon, cela dit, je suis la seule membre de\ncette association...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006F006E002C002000630065006C00610020006400690074002C0020006A0065002000730075006900730020006C00610020007300650075006C00650020006D0065006D006200720065002000640065000A006300650074007400650020006100730073006F00630069006100740069006F006E002E002E002E001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bref... Tu sais ce qu’est une forme régionale ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nNe réponds pas, c’est une question rhétorique\net je vais continuer à parler, de toute façon.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 148
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Certains Pokémon changent d’apparence\nlorsqu’ils s’adaptent à certaines régions.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Même le célèbre Pikachu évolue différemment\nà Alola.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00EA006D00650020006C00650020006300E9006C00E8006200720065002000500069006B0061006300680075002000E90076006F006C007500650020006400690066006600E900720065006D006D0065006E0074000A00E000200041006C006F006C0061002E001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Plutôt que d’expliquer les différences, c’est plus\nfacile de voir les deux formes pour les comparer !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voilà ce que je te propose !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nFaisons un combat ! Toi avec un Raichu banal,\ncontre moi avec mon Raichu d’Alola !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 119
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lorsque tu auras un Raichu prêt à affronter son\nhomologue d’Alola, reviens me voir !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Faisons un combat ! Toi avec un Raichu banal,\ncontre moi avec mon Raichu d’Alola !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAssure-toi de n’avoir aucun autre Pokémon\ndans ton équipe, et j’en ferai de même !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 173
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un Raichu d’Alola ! Qu’il est charmant !\nMais je veux voir un Raichu normal ! Tout seul !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, quel beau Raichu ! Splendide !\nVeux-tu qu’il affronte mon Raichu d’Alola ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F004B002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas maintenant.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006100730020006D00610069006E00740065006E0061006E0074002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Accepte, s’il te plaît ! Au nom de l’Union de Lutte\npour le Triomphe des Raichu d’Alola !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tous les Raichu sont chou, mais celui d’Alola\nl’est encore plus, car son type est différent !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’était un très beau combat !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMais il me reste encore une mission à accomplir,\nau nom de l’ULTRA.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Faisons un échange ! Mon Raichu d’Alola\ncontre ton Raichu !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006100690073006F006E007300200075006E002000E9006300680061006E00670065002000210020004D006F006E00200052006100690063006800750020006420190041006C006F006C0061000A0063006F006E00740072006500200074006F006E002000520061006900630068007500200021001000020114016A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Échangeons !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C9006300680061006E00670065006F006E0073002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non merci.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F006E0020006D0065007200630069002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est ULTRA-dommage ! Je ne bougerai pas d’ici,\ndonc si tu changes d’avis, reviens me voir !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En échangeant nos Raichu, la Forme d’Alola\nprolifère ! C’est ni-ckel ! ♪<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je comprends ! Parfois, cela arrache le cœur\nd’échanger son Pokémon tant aimé.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les Raichu d’Alola sont merveilleux... mais il est\nvrai que les normaux ont un petit je-ne-sais-quoi !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Rai rai !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0052006100690020007200610069002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quant à moi, je rentre à Alola pour tisser des liens\navec d’autres Raichu de là-bas, et continuer à les<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nfaire proliférer à travers le monde.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nL’Union de Lutte pour le Triomphe des Raichu\nd’Alola a encore du pain sur la planche de surf !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŪ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
